        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Egan?s are delighted to present this spacious two-bedroom apartment to the open market for sale. This well-proportioned property offers comfortable accommodation comprising an entrance hallway, spacious living room with adjoining kitchen, WC, storage room and two generously sized bedrooms.\n\nThe property would make an ideal starter home or an excellent investment opportunity, offering well-presented accommodation in a convenient location.\n\nSituated within a short distance of Mullingar town centre, Mullingar General Hospital, primary and secondary schools, and a wide range of local amenities, the property is ideally positioned for both convenience and accessibility.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a shared secure rear garden.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through Egan?s."
